infographic sequence-funnel-simple
data
  title The grace period is a budget, not a guarantee
  desc The default 30s is spent phase by phase — under 20s is left to finish in-flight work
  sequences
    - label Grace period — 30s
      desc terminationGracePeriodSeconds default
    - label minus preStop sleep
      desc routing propagation, ~5–15s
    - label minus keep-alive drain
      desc finish open connections
    - label minus resource teardown
      desc reverse-dependency order
    - label minus guardian margin
      desc force-exit before SIGKILL
    - label Residual — under 20s
      desc all that is left to finish work
theme
  palette #14b8a6 #f59e0b #f43f5e
